<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="small">Draft, last updated 14 October 2026. Placeholder pending legal review.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><p>The site has no accounts. Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, processes standard request logs (such as IP address and user agent) to deliver and protect the site. We may add Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or track individuals across sites.</p>
<h2>Email</h2><p>If you email <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai">hello@swarmnest.ai</a>, we keep the message to reply to you. If a newsletter launches, we will store only the address you give us, use it for that newsletter, and include an unsubscribe link in every issue.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell personal data. Service providers such as Cloudflare process data on our behalf.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>Email us to ask what we hold or to have it deleted.</p>
